</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/69c17458-76e4-11f1-9ecc-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-Un-homme-meurt-apr%C3%A8s-s-%C3%AAtre-immol%C3%A9-par-le-feu-devant-les-Nations-unies-03072026-NY.png"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/69c17458-76e4-11f1-9ecc-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-Un-homme-meurt-apr%C3%A8s-s-%C3%AAtre-immol%C3%A9-par-le-feu-devant-les-Nations-unies-03072026-NY.png" type="image/png" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">a7c2027a-76e1-11f1-a0f6-89fafada31dc</guid><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 13:40:38 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/69c17458-76e4-11f1-9ecc-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-Un-homme-meurt-apr%C3%A8s-s-%C3%AAtre-immol%C3%A9-par-le-feu-devant-les-Nations-unies-03072026-NY.png">© Reuters 路透视频截图</source><dc:creator>古莉</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>加拿大与菲律宾提升为战略伙伴关系</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260703-%E5%8A%A0%E6%8B%BF%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%8E%E8%8F%B2%E5%BE%8B%E5%AE%BE%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E4%B8%BA%E6%88%98%E7%95%A5%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%B4%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB</link><description>
